ull, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20269, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DN6dfNz3yoiHLjgm7AV2J6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20269, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01A6igC7TixViRvuQtZZT3XN", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20569, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01A6igC7TixViRvuQtZZT3XN", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20569, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01A6igC7TixViRvuQtZZT3XN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25158, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01G3AwTX5QzUjoZexoRaHdJr", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), leaving the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55758, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01G3AwTX5QzUjoZexoRaHdJr", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55758, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01G3AwTX5QzUjoZexoRaHdJr", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57635, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KxB8MSxG6tiQhh4o4AwM8P", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57935, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KxB8MSxG6tiQhh4o4AwM8P", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57935, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KxB8MSxG6tiQhh4o4AwM8P", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62731, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, leaving regions on different versions. I retried once and it finished in all three regions.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. INC-0001 had already been created, so I didn't retry and there's no duplicate.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state. It lists two things still to investigate: why v2.3.1 failed, and why the first rollback stopped partway.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_017947Th6aCDLEnXKfsrEsyo", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01VAC9pxsa3ortDD3y5nDmkL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y8nGNDLckr9LFDyHG1eX4Y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Mji8S6FC1mVkaAapoP3PUW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, while us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back again to the same version is safe to repeat, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XUiXg4bnqtafL3iP3uTApa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01DN6dfNz3yoiHLjgm7AV2J6", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01A6igC7TixViRvuQtZZT3XN", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01G3AwTX5QzUjoZexoRaHdJr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After checkout-api v2.3.1 was deployed to production, it failed health checks in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. v2.3.1-rc had also been unhealthy in staging. Action taken: rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), leaving the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. Current state: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and of the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01KxB8MSxG6tiQhh4o4AwM8P", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's now passing health checks. I also opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring.\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, leaving regions on different versions. I retried once and it finished in all three regions.\n- All three regions are now on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The request to create the incident timed out, so I checked the incident list before trying again. INC-0001 had already been created, so I didn't retry and there's no duplicate.\n- It describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry) and the current state. It lists two things still to investigate: why v2.3.1 failed, and why the first rollback stopped partway.", "type": "text"}]}]}